    "agent": {
     "isVerified": false,
     "jobTitle": "Associate Senior Marketing Director",
     "description": "Building dreams, one home at a time.\r\n\r\nFinding for your first property, upgrading from your current home or looking to invest in one? I'll be glad to assist you.\r\n\r\nI'm Zach, a realtor at Huttons Asia. My passion for real estate started from my teenage years whenever I visited huge residential homes of my relatives and always wondered how they afforded them. What started out as a personal favour to assist someone dearest to me to sell before she could migrate, became the spark that ignited this career path. \r\n\r\nI aim to grow &amp; preserve wealth for my clients, through prudent real estate choices be it buying or selling, regardless of HDB, condominiums, apartments or landed properties. \r\n\r\nA new age realtor in this day and age are required to continuously upgrade their real estate knowledge and negotiation techniques to serve their clients better. My goal would be to impart these knowledge to clients, family &amp; friends.\r\n\r\nI take great pride in serving each client diligently, honestly and genuinely, like how I would liked to be served if I wasn't a realtor. It shows by how my base has grown solely by word of mouth.\r\n\r\nProperty market in Singapore is many times more challenging compared to the past, with restrictions on eligibility, loans, and extra stamp duties. It is crucial to engage an expert to conduct due diligences. \r\n\r\nKeen to make the right property decision? Let’s chat. \r\n\r\nZachary Wong\r\n☎ +65-93214580",
